        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: shorten sanity-pfl test_8 dbench run",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: shorten sanity-pfl test_8 dbench run\n\nsanity-pfl test_8 ran dbench for its default 600s plus a\n120s warmup, about 12 minutes. The dbench loadfile writes\nno file larger than 1.9MB, so with the 2M/16M/EOF layout\nonly the first component was ever instantiated however\nlong dbench ran.\n\nRun dbench for 60s and shrink the component extents to\n256K/1M/EOF so the larger dbench files instantiate all\nthree components.\n\nsanity-pfl test_8 in a single-node VM: 722s before, 74s\nafter.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-pfl env=ONLY=8\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iedf71bdeb5f36bf15ceff430e7ece9cfce231725\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
